---
import Layout from '../../../../layouts/Layout.astro'
import DayRating from '../../rateDay/rateDay.astro'

export const post = {
  day: 43,
  title: 'Day 44',
  date: '2026-10-19',
  description: 'first day of new week',
  category: 'Daily',
  tags: ['Astro', 'Tailwind CSS', 'Web Development'],
}
---

<Layout>
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 pb-24 pt-32">
    <!-- Header -->
    <header class="mb-16">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-sm">
        <span
          class="font-medium uppercase tracking-widest text-[var(--secondary)]"
        >
          {post.category}
        </span>

        <span class="text-[var(--border)]">/</span>

        <span class="text-[var(--muted)]">
          Day {post.day}
        </span>
      </div>

      <h1
        class="mt-6 text-4xl font-bold leading-tight tracking-tight sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl"
      >
        {post.title}
      </h1>

      <p class="mt-5 text-sm text-[var(--muted)]">
        {
          new Date(post.date).toLocaleDateString('en-GB', {
            day: 'numeric',
            month: 'long',
            year: 'numeric',
          })
        }
      </p>

      <p
        class="mt-8 border-l-2 border-[var(--secondary)] pl-5 text-lg leading-8 text-[var(--muted)] sm:text-xl"
      >
        {post.description}
      </p>
    </header>

    <!-- Content -->
    <div class="space-y-14 leading-8">
      <!-- Section -->
      <section>
        <h2 class="mb-5 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl">
          What I did today?
        </h2>
        <p>
          Today, I had only two lessons, and both of them was easy, I give my
          bike for service to decathlon where he did what he could, I think it's
          better than before, but If this bike will break or idk, I'll buy
          better one, I also review my diet, and it's not prefectly balansed
          becouse I don't eat any friuts, and I eat less fiber than it's
          recommended, so I decided to add oatmeal with friuts to my daily diet,
          I also listen one episone of luke english podcast, I learn
          math(matrices), I also read book as I wanted, and I installed app for
          planing, and I planed what I'll do tomorrow in steps, I'm thinking
          about adding, new section to my blog, where I'll have my habits/goals,
          and review how many of them I did, It sounds great for me.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>

    <!-- Section -->
    <section class="py-5">
      <h2 class="mb-5 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl">
        Plans for tomorrow
      </h2>

      <p>
        I'll go to studies, I'll buy products for oatmeal, I'll go at treinign,
        and I'll learn math for matuer, and I'll do part of desing course
      </p>

      <!-- Section -->
      <section>
        <h2 class="mb-5 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl">
          How I rate this day
        </h2>
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <p>
            I'll give 6/10, I did everything, I wanted to do, and I was too
            tired to do more, so I think I use this day as I should, I hope my
            next days, will look like today
          </p>
          <DayRating class="w-full" rating={6} />
        </div>
      </section>
    </section>
  </article>
</Layout>
